CHANGES MADE
------------

cgroup-hk.json is ADAPTED MATERIAL, not a verbatim copy. The Lua source was
parsed and restructured:

  * each Item() call became one JSON record;
  * the zh-hk value was promoted to a `zh_hk` field, and every other string in
    the entry (the Japanese original, the conversion source words, and the
    zh / zh-hans / zh-hant / zh-cn / zh-tw / zh-mo / zh-sg / zh-my values) was
    collected into a sorted `keys` array;
  * entries carrying no zh-hk value were dropped, as were the 術語 (terminology)
    and 人名 (personal name) sections, which are not work titles;
  * MediaWiki conversion markup (e.g. `}--{-|…`) was discarded.

No value text was translated, corrected, or otherwise rewritten.


